  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3008.02 Recordkeeping",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3008.02 Recordkeeping. The director shall require persons certifying and using ERCs to collect, maintain, and submit data, in accordance with Env-A 900, necessary to ensure that ERCs are, and remain, in compliance with all requirements of this chapter and the Act, and with the conditions of the ERC certificates issued hereunder.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
